@UserService.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5145

### Register
POST {{UserService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "testuser",
  "password": "password123",
  "favorites": ["USD", "EUR"]
}

###
### Login
POST {{UserService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

###
### Logout (requires Bearer token)
POST {{UserService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/user/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "jti": "your-jti-from-login",
  "expiresAtUtc": "2025-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

###
### Update favorites (requires Bearer token)
PUT {{UserService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/user/favorites
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "favorites": ["USD", "EUR", "GBP"]
}

###
